    "notes": "Jargon - Specialized language used by a specific group or industry.\nNonverbal Communication - Using gestures and expressions instead of words.\nTechnical Problems - Issues related to technology or complex systems.\nEffective Collaboration - Working together to solve shared challenges.\nCommunication Barriers - Factors that prevent clear understanding (like jargon).",
