    "notes": "Patience - Staying calm and persistent when convicing others of an idea.\nObjectivity - Remaining unbiased and open, even when faced with feedback.\nFeedback Rejection - A negative response to critique that halts growth.\nConstructive Disagreement - Respectfully debating ideas to find the best solution.\nInterpersonal Skills - Abilities used to communicate and interact with others.",
