    "notes": "Customer Service - Providing high-quality assistance to clients and patrons.\nTelephone Etiquette - Professional behavior when answering and handling calls.\nCall Routing - Connecting callers to the correct person or department.\nWait Management - Minimizing time callers spend on hold to avoid irritation.\nBusiness Perception - How customers view a company based on interactions.",
