    "notes": "Email Etiquette - Professional standards for electronic communication.\nProofreading - Checking for spelling and grammar errors before sending.\nSubject Line - A concise summary of the email's topic for the reader.\nResponse Time - The speed at which an individual replies to messages.\nAttachment Management - Ensuring files sent are necessary and appropriate.",
