    "notes": "Informational Message - Intended to inform and provide data to recipients.\nDecision Making - The process of choosing a course of action from options.\nData Inclusion - Providing sufficient facts for a recipient to act.\nClarification - Ensuring the who, what, where, and when are understood.\nConcise Writing - Brief and clear communication that improves readability.",
