    "notes": "Letters of Inquiry - Written requests for information or appointments.\nPersuasive Messages - Designed to encourage others to take a specific action.\nSales Letters - A type of persuasive message focused on selling.\nInternal Communication - Corporate memos used within a business.\nAppointment Requests - Scheduling meetings with associates or customers.",
