    "notes": "Customer Inquiries - Questions or requests for info from patrons.\nProfessional Response - Answering in a way that builds customer trust.\nInformation Gathering - The process of finding answers to client questions.\nTelephone Standards - Guidelines for effective business phone interaction.\nValidation - Acknowledging the importance of a customer's question.",
