    "text": "When the contract negotiations between the labor union and Sweet Confections Candy Company stalled, union members decided not to buy any of the company's products until an agreement was reached. Union members also encouraged their friends and family to stop buying the company's candy, too. What pressure strategy did the labor union use to facilitate resolution with management?",
