    "notes": "SOURCE: CO:060\nSOURCE: Clark, B., Basteri, C.G., Gassen, C., & Walker, M. (2014). Marketing dynamics (3rd ed.) [pp. 544, 548-549]. Tinley Park, IL: The Goodheart-Willcox Co.",
