    "notes": "SOURCE: CO:061\nSOURCE: Hyden, J.S., Jordan, A.K., Steinauer, M.H., & Jones, M.J. (2006). Communicating for success (3rd ed.) [pp. 335-336]. Mason, OH: Thomson South-Western.",
